    "sections": {
        "description": "ST Cosmetic Surgery is a modern, clean, and professional WordPress theme designed for cosmetic surgery clinics, plastic surgeons, aesthetic centers, dermatology clinics, beauty specialists, and medical practices. It features an elegant layout that helps showcase treatments, doctor profiles, before-and-after galleries, patient testimonials, pricing, and appointment information with a polished and trustworthy appearance. Built with performance, accessibility, and responsiveness in mind, ST Cosmetic Surgery delivers a seamless experience across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. The theme is optimized for speed, SEO, and compatibility with the latest version of WordPress, making it easy to create a professional online presence without compromising performance."
    },
